**Specialized Agents needed (at minimum):**
- Quality Agent (functional testing, performance, resilience)
- Security Agent
- Architecture Agent
- Documentation Agent

**Core Novel Feature – Evolutionary Selection:**
- Store successful agent configurations as “lineages”
- Weight future runs toward historically successful lineages
- Occasionally mutate prompts/skills
- Track accept/reject counts per lineage
- Prune weak lineages

